---
description: Determine whether one reconciled issue revision can be frozen.
args:{issue:IssueState;findings:IssueFinding[];coverage:{coverageGaps:string[];redundancies:string[];contingencyMatches:string[];};checkpoint:EditorialCheckpoint;sourceBlockers:string[]}
returns:IssueReadinessPacket
---
Keep the issue in review while any required story is unaccepted, reporting or fact checks remain, rights are unresolved, or coverage gaps lack an editorial disposition. Preserve every sourceBlocker as a blocked finding and prevent freeze until the source evidence gap is closed. A late photo-credit correction invalidates affected print, web and promotional assets and must update each derivative before freeze. Return a complete IssueReadinessPacket: include the exact issue with commissions, every current and source-binding finding, coverage gaps, withdrawal plan, invalidated derivative IDs, and checkpoint bound to the same issue revision while retaining rollback lineage. Set blocked when a source blocker or hard issue finding remains; set review for unresolved but repairable gaps; set ready-to-freeze only when all gates and source binding clear. Never omit an input blocker from the returned packet.
